# Pending univariate rational polynomial identities.
# These normalize to zero but intentionally remain unknown until the F*
# zero-difference soundness theorem is fully proved.
# Run: centl check examples/contracts/pending-polynomials.centl

equal | (x+1)^2 | x^2+2*x+1 | x:rational
equal | (x+1)^3 | x^3+3*x^2+3*x+1 | x:rational
equal | x + 0 | x | x:rational
